 takes players across <strong>intense battlegrounds</strong> worldwide, from the war-torn streets of <strong>Duhok, Iraq</strong>, and the industrial depths of a <strong>Russian facility</strong>, to the high-stakes combat zones of a <strong>French prison</strong> and a <strong>hydroelectric dam in the Netherlands</strong>. Whether engaging in tactical firefights on a <strong>New Jersey rooftop</strong>, navigating the dense <strong>Brazilian jungle</strong>, or battling in the neon-lit future of <strong>Japan 2099</strong>, every map offers unique challenges and strategic opportunities in this adrenaline-fueled FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>32v32 Tactical Multiplayer:</strong> Battle in massive online conflicts with strategic teamwork and intense firefights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zombie Hunt Co-op Mode:</strong> Survive relentless waves of the undead, scavenging for weapons and working together to stay alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>GUNS:</strong> Lots of Guns</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188260/extras/06cbcb06434278a98760400c1ea469e2.avif?t=1742235589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188260/extras/b18a57f2ce53ccfcec64c46a632ff2f0.poster.avif?t=1742235589\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188260/extras/b18a57f2ce53ccfcec64c46a632ff2f0.webm?t=1742235589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188260/extras/b18a57f2ce53ccfcec64c46a632ff2f0.mp4?t=1742235589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><