rong>Secondary Weapons:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Colt 1911 Pistol</strong> \u2013 A legendary sidearm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beretta 9mm</strong> \u2013 Well-rounded and reliable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SOCOM</strong> \u2013 Tactical pistol with elite military use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sig Sauer .45</strong> \u2013 A powerful semi-auto handgun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Melee &amp; Special Weapons:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bowie Knife</strong> \u2013 Classic combat blade for silent takedowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Katana Sword</strong> \u2013 A high-style, deadly melee option.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Punch / Kick / CQC</strong> \u2013 Hand-to-hand combat for brutal takedowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>American Thompson</strong> \u2013 A historic SMG with nostalgic appeal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Toy Foam Dart Repeater</strong> \u2013 A fun, gimmick weapon for lighthearted combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>YOU'RE INVITED!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188260/extras/cc67b733ffae65599c5237380dd895f0.avif?t=1742235589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our Discord and help influence the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our Discord where you are encourge you to leave feedback and feature requests and participate in scheduled group gaming sessions. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188260/extras/97df3fe7f22fbad569edba9d593b8392.webp?t=1742235589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;My brother and I are actively developing and improving our game, aiming to deliver a high-quality experience for military game enthusiasts. As our skills grow, we\u2019ll continue refining the game, implementing new features, and listening to player feedback. We\u2019d love for you to join us on this journey\u2014your support and input mean a lot. Hope you enjoy the game!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>-Kevin &amp; Sean, the Devs</i></p>",
